      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. so if i'm hitting those temps exactly, i should be fine. but what if i see the bloom starting to appear even when i think i'm following the curve? is there any way to tell the difference between sugar bloom and fat bloom just by looking at it? i want to be sure i'm not wasting a batch.",
